---

<BaseLayout
  title="Tote Bag Spunbond Custom Event & Pameran: Katalog Model & Harga Pabrik"
  description="Katalog tote bag spunbond custom 75 gsm dan 100 gsm untuk goodie bag pameran, expo dagang, dan promosi massal. Harga pabrik mulai Rp 4.500, MOQ 100 pcs."
  canonicalUrl="https://totebag.web.id/produk/tote-bag-spunbond/"
  ogImage="https://totebag.web.id/media/tote-bag-spunbond-color.webp"
  jsonLd={schemaJson}
>
  <!-- Topbar Announcement Strip -->
  <aside class="spunbond-topbar py-2 text-center text-white small" style="background-color: var(--brand-primary, #173F38);" aria-label="Informasi konveksi spunbond">
    <div class="container">
      Pabrik Konveksi Tote Bag Spunbond Press &amp; Jahit Box • Pilihan 75 GSM &amp; 100 GSM • Kirim Ribuan Pcs Seluruh Indonesia
    </div>
  </aside>

  <!-- Breadcrumbs & Quick-Nav In-Page Navigation -->
  <div class="container pt-3">
    <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />
    <nav class="quick-nav d-none d-md-flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-2 pb-1" aria-label="Navigasi cepat halaman spunbond">
      <span class="small fw-semibold text-muted align-self-center me-1">Lompat ke:</span>
      <a href="#katalog-produk" class="badge bg-white text-dark border text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">Katalog Model &amp; Harga</a>
      <a href="#tabel-harga" class="badge bg-white text-dark border text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">Tabel Harga Grosir</a>
      <a href="#keunggulan" class="badge bg-white text-dark border text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">Keunggulan Spunbond</a>
      <a href="#faq" class="badge bg-white text-dark border text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill">FAQ</a>
      <a href="#penawaran" class="badge badge-cta bg-brand text-white text-decoration-none px-3 py-2 rounded-pill shadow-sm">Minta Penawaran</a>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <!-- Hero Header Section -->
  <section class="section-space-sm pt-3 pb-4 hero-spunbond" id="konten">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row align-items-center g-4 g-lg-5">
        <div class="col-12 col-lg-7">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="badge-accent">KATALOG PRODUK &amp; PABRIK SPUNBOND</span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="hero-title mb-3">
            Tote Bag Spunbond Custom: Solusi Hemat untuk Pameran &amp; Promosi Massal
          </h1>

          <p class="lead text-muted fs-5 mb-3" style="line-height: 1.7;">
            Solusi tas goodie bag paling efisien biaya untuk pameran dagang, seminar massal, expo, dan pembagian sembako. Tersedia pilihan ketebalan 75 gsm press hingga 100 gsm jahit box dengan puluhan pilihan warna cerah siap sablon.
          </p>

          <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-4">
            <a href="#katalog-produk" class="btn btn-brand btn-lg">
              Lihat 4 Model Produk ↓
            </a>
            <a href="#penawaran" class="btn btn-brand-outline btn-lg">
              Konsultasi WhatsApp
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-muted small">
            <span><strong class="text-success">✓</strong> Mulai Rp 4.500 / pcs (MOQ 100 pcs)</span>
            <span><strong class="text-success">✓</strong> Pilihan Press Ultrasonic &amp; Jahit Box</span>
            <span><strong class="text-success">✓</strong> Tersedia 20+ Pilihan Warna Kain</span>
            <span><strong class="text-success">✓</strong> Kapasitas Produksi 20.000+ Pcs/Bulan</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-12 col-lg-5">
          <div class="position-relative">
            <div class="ratio ratio-4x3 rounded-4 overflow-hidden border shadow-sm">
              <img 
                src="/media/tote-bag-spunbond-color.webp" 
                alt="Tote bag spunbond warna-warni untuk souvenir event dan pameran massal" 
                width="800" 
                height="600" 
                class="w-100 h-100 object-fit-cover"
                loading="eager"
                fetchpriority="high"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="position-absolute bottom-0 end-0 m-3 px-3 py-2 bg-white rounded-3 shadow-sm border text-dark d-none d-sm-block" style="max-width: 250px; z-index: 5;">
              <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                <span class="badge rounded-circle p-1 bg-success text-white" style="width: 22px; height: 22px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 11px;">✓</span>
                <div>
                  <strong class="d-block text-brand fw-bold" style="font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.2;">Efisiensi Anggaran</strong>
                  <span class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.2;">Mulai Rp 2.900 pada Skala Ribuan Pcs</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MARKETPLACE CATALOG SECTION (Tampil Langsung di Depan) -->
  <section class="section-space pt-2 pb-5" id="katalog-produk">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-end mb-4">
        <div>
          <span class="badge-accent mb-2">PILIHAN MODEL SIAP ORDER</span>
          <h2 class="section-title mb-1">Katalog Model Tote Bag Spunbond</h2>
          <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Klik tombol penawaran pada model yang sesuai untuk langsung mengirimkan brief ke tim sales kami.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-2 mt-md-0">
          <span class="badge bg-light text-dark border px-3 py-2 rounded-pill small">MOQ Standar: 100 Pcs per Desain</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Grid 4 Model Marketplace Cards -->
      <div class="row g-4 mb-5">
        {spunbondModels.map(item => (
          <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
            <article class="card h-100 rounded-4 bg-white border shadow-sm overflow-hidden d-flex flex-column">
              <!-- Product Image Wrapper -->
              <a href={`/produk/${item.slug}/`} class="d-block position-relative overflow-hidden border-bottom text-decoration-none">
                <div class="ratio ratio-4x3 bg-light">
                  <img 
                    src={item.image} 
                    alt={`${item.name} bahan spunbond event custom logo`}
                    width="600" 
                    height="450" 
                    class="w-100 h-100 object-fit-cover"
                    loading="lazy"
                  />
                </div>
                <span class={`position-absolute top-0 end-0 m-3 badge ${item.badgeClass} rounded-pill shadow-sm`} style="font-size: 0.75rem; z-index: 2;">
                  {item.badge}
                </span>
              </a>

              <!-- Product Details -->
              <div class="p-4 d-flex flex-column flex-grow-1">
                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-1">
                  <span class="text-muted small fw-bold">{item.code} • {item.category}</span>
                  <span class="badge bg-light text-dark border small">MOQ {item.moq}</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="h5 fw-bold mb-2">
                  <a href={`/produk/${item.slug}/`} class="text-dark text-decoration-none hover-underline">
                    {item.name}
                  </a>
                </h3>

                <div class="p-2 mb-3 rounded-2 bg-surface-alt border">
                  <div class="d-flex justify-content-between small text-muted">
                    <span>Bahan &amp; Metode:</span>
                    <strong class="text-dark">{item.material}</strong>
                  </div>
                  <div class="d-flex justify-content-between small text-muted">
                    <span>Ukuran Standar:</span>
                    <strong class="text-dark">{item.dimensions}</strong>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3">
                  <div class="text-muted small fw-bold mb-1">Spesifikasi Fitur:</div>
                  <ul class="list-unstyled small text-muted mb-0 d-flex flex-column gap-1">
                    {item.features.map(f => (
                      <li class="d-flex align-items-start gap-1">
                        <span class="text-success fw-bold">✓</span>
                        <span>{f}</span>
                      </li>
                    ))}
                  </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-auto pt-3 border-top">
                  <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-baseline mb-3">
                    <div>
                      <span class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.75rem;">Mulai dari:</span>
                      <div class="h4 fw-bold text-brand mb-0">{item.price} <small class="text-muted fw-normal" style="font-size: 0.75rem;">/ pcs</small></div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="small text-muted text-end">{item.priceRange}</span>
                  </div>

                  <div class="row g-2">
                    <div class="col-6">
                      <a href={`/produk/${item.slug}/`} class="btn btn-outline-dark w-100 btn-sm py-2 fw-semibold">
                        Detail Produk
                      </a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-6">
                      <a 
                        href={`https://wa.me/6282131087971?text=${encodeURIComponent(item.waMessage)}`} 
                        target="_blank" 
                        rel="noopener noreferrer" 
                        class="btn btn-brand w-100 btn-sm py-2 fw-semibold"
                      >
                        Minta Penawaran
                      </a>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <!-- Tabel Skala Harga Grosir Spunbond -->
      <div class="p-4 p-lg-5 rounded-4 bg-white border shadow-sm mb-4" id="tabel-harga">
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3">
          <div>
            <h3 class="h4 fw-bold mb-1">Tabel Skala Harga Grosir Tote Bag Spunbond</h3>
            <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Harga semakin murah untuk pesanan expo ratusan hingga ribuan pcs berkat efisiensi potong rol kain otomatis.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="badge bg-success-subtle text-success fw-bold px-3 py-2 rounded-pill mt-2 mt-md-0">Pabrik Konveksi Langsung</span>
        </div>

        <div class="table-responsive">
          <table class="table table-bordered table-specs align-middle mb-0">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th scope="col">Model &amp; Spesifikasi Spunbond</th>
                <th scope="col" class="text-center">100 - 299 Pcs</th>
                <th scope="col" class="text-center">300 - 499 Pcs</th>
                <th scope="col" class="text-center">500 - 999 Pcs</th>
                <th scope="col" class="text-center bg-success-subtle">1.000 - 2.999 Pcs</th>
                <th scope="col" class="text-center bg-success text-white">3.000+ Pcs</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>SPN-01</strong> Flat Spunbond Press 75 GSM (25 x 35 cm)</td>
                <td class="text-center fw-bold">Rp 4.500</td>
                <td class="text-center">Rp 3.800</td>
                <td class="text-center">Rp 3.400</td>
                <td class="text-center bg-success-subtle fw-bold">Rp 3.100</td>
                <td class="text-center bg-success-subtle text-success fw-bold">Rp 2.900</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>SPN-02</strong> Spunbond Jahit Box Gusset 75 GSM (30 x 40 x 10 cm)</td>
                <td class="text-center fw-bold">Rp 6.500</td>
                <td class="text-center">Rp 5.800</td>
                <td class="text-center">Rp 5.200</td>
                <td class="text-center bg-success-subtle fw-bold">Rp 4.800</td>
                <td class="text-center bg-success-subtle text-success fw-bold">Rp 4.500</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>SPN-03</strong> Spunbond Jahit Heavy 100 GSM (35 x 40 x 10 cm)</td>
                <td class="text-center fw-bold">Rp 8.500</td>
                <td class="text-center">Rp 7.600</td>
                <td class="text-center">Rp 7.000</td>
                <td class="text-center bg-success-subtle fw-bold">Rp 6.600</td>
                <td class="text-center bg-success-subtle text-success fw-bold">Rp 6.200</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>SPN-04</strong> Spunbond Serut Drawstring Ransel (30 x 40 cm)</td>
                <td class="text-center fw-bold">Rp 7.500</td>
                <td class="text-center">Rp 6.800</td>
                <td class="text-center">Rp 6.000</td>
                <td class="text-center bg-success-subtle fw-bold">Rp 5.600</td>
                <td class="text-center bg-success-subtle text-success fw-bold">Rp 5.200</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p class="small text-muted mt-3 mb-0">
          *Harga sudah termasuk sablon 1 warna 1 sisi. Penambahan warna sablon dapat dikonfirmasi saat penyerahan desain.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- KEUNGGULAN SPUNBOND -->
  <section class="section-space bg-surface-alt" id="keunggulan">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-w-75 mb-4">
        <span class="badge-accent mb-2">KARAKTERISTIK KAIN</span>
